 "remarks": "The sun never sets at Sunrise Hill condominiums where an abundance of amenities in a pet friendly community make for a robust living experience. This most sought after Norwalk-centric complex includes an in-ground pool, tennis courts and playground in a well cared for private setting. The Townhouse unit is situated close to the association entrance for easy entrance exit without dealing with all the speed bumps and is within a very short walk to the pool. The condo boasts a warming Living Room wood burning fireplace, Eat In Kitchen and Bathroom upgrades with the balance of finished area in a well cared for bright and convenient configuration. Generously sized Bedrooms and Bath on the second level come with ample closet space complimented by an attic for incremental storage. The lower level contains an estimated 450 square feet of living space not included in the overall square footage which includes a comfortable family room, sliders to a rear fenced in yard, laundry/utility room and yet even more storage area with a southern exposure. Natural gas forced hot air heating coupled with Central Air Conditioning and gas cooking make for an efficient low cost monthly overhead. Ample guest parking, hyper local shopping and I95/Merritt Parkway access make for easy travel.",
